      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "义务？跟我谈恋爱，用不着拿出尽义务的心态。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "喜欢我的人是因为我的魅力，爱我的人是因为我的心，你不需要做出以身相许的状态。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "好了，开个玩笑。一路平安！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杰瑞哥交代过我了，您在美国日程上要是有什么改变随时通知我，我二十四小时开机。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "以后日程上的事，你不用管了。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Riding toward the airport together after Huimei leaves, Bu Xiaogu dutifully offers round-the-clock schedule updates—only for Chun Yuqiao to tell her quietly not to handle his calendar anymore. See you in Episode 12!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "再见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
